    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Inside his sovereign immortal aperture, Mini Southern Border, Fang Yuan raises white steel bowl valley, which coagulates white steel extract that lets him feed rank seven edge Gu himself. After plundering Tie Qu Zhong’s immortal aperture he had found no feed resources for edge Gu, then learned from soul search that Tie Qu Zhong meant to build that resource point and had already discussed a price with Shang Hu Zhang; Fang Yuan instead extorted Shang clan and built it without paying.",
        "chapters": [
          1616
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
