  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In The Legends of Ren Zu, Ren Zu walks Ordinary Abyss and steps on edge Gu in the ground; the sharp edges injure his soles, the wounds widen, and blood flows as pain strikes deep within him. Many wild edge Gu are produced in nature; autumn blade plain is one of the few production areas in the five regions, controlled by Meng tribe. Meng Tu, having failed to reach blade path great grandmaster on his own, copies Ren Zu’s example by inserting edge Gu into his own heart to deepen his grasp of blade path; the killer move this produces is incomplete, carries serious side effects, and periodically pushes his mind into a mad, demonic state.",
        "chapters": [
          1563
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
          "char_ren_zu",
          "loc_ordinary_abyss",
          "fac_meng_tribe",
          "char_meng_tribe_meng_tu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Myriad Self Immortal Gu’s recipe needs an enormous amount of edge Gu, plus drinking blade wine from under autumn blade plain.",
        "chapters": [
          1563
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-stock",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "rcp_myriad_self_immortal_gu_recipe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan kills Meng Tu there and steals hundreds of edge Gu while taking the drinking blade wine; the battle destroys almost all of the plain’s edge Gu, though its growth potential grows afterward since Meng Tu’s dying blade path dao marks become engraved in the land.",
        "chapters": [
          1565
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-stock",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Drinking blade wine, edge Gu, front-back divine obstruction needles, and floating life fire are named as four main immortal materials gathered for that work.",
        "chapters": [
          1569
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-stock",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "res_drinking_blade_wine"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan uses great thief ghost hand and steals Tie Qu Zhong’s Immortal Gu. Tie Qu Zhong cries out for his rank seven edge Gu as his killer move fails from backlash. Fang Yuan is pleased: this edge Gu is one of the core Immortal Gu of the killer move time cutting edge.",
        "chapters": [
          1603
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "theft-for-time-cutting-edge",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Tie Qu Zhong’s immortal aperture is also taken away from him.",
        "chapters": [
          1616
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "theft-for-time-cutting-edge",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s time path clone undergoes a Spring Autumn Cicada rebirth, its will returning to an earlier point in his own timeline.",
        "chapters": [
          1749
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "edge-gu-after-the-rebirth",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In a later reckoning of his time path Immortal Gu for a campaign against Heavenly Court, Fang Yuan still counts a rank seven edge Gu from Tie Qu Zhong and use of time cutting edge among what he lacks.",
        "chapters": [
          1751
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "edge-gu-after-the-rebirth",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_heavenly_court"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Facing Tie Qu Zhong again in the years flow execution formation battle, Fang Yuan recalls stealing this edge Gu with great thief ghost hand only in his previous life, and resolves to be careful in repeating it this life.",
        "chapters": [
          1784
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "edge-gu-after-the-rebirth",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "White steel bowl valley is a project Tie Qu Zhong wants but has not started; Fang Yuan fills the gap himself, completing it a second time and more easily than in the previous life.",
        "chapters": [
          1798
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "edge-gu-after-the-rebirth",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "res_white_steel"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Raiding autumn blade plain again for myriad self Immortal Gu’s ingredients, Fang Yuan kills Meng Tu with Luo Po seal rather than facing a self-detonation, then loots the site, taking a vast number of mortal edge Gu. Immortal level edge Gu is not among the plunder: Fang Yuan notes it still sits in Southern Border Gu Immortal Tie Qu Zhong’s hands.",
        "chapters": [
          1752
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "second-raid-on-autumn-blade-plain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_myriad_self_immortal_gu",
          "reg_southern_border",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Inside The Legends of Ren Zu, once Ren Zu dies after surrendering every heart to the Predicament’s Tribulations, rules and regulation Gu declares itself free and departs. Courage Gu and edge Gu leave alongside it, treating Ren Zu’s death as an unsalvageable defeat.",
        "chapters": [
          2053
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "named-beside-courage-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_courage_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
